# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:2
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_d1a49c6c:

    # "The man nodded, and as he stepped towards one of the other guards, he suddenly unsheathed his blade and slashed him down!"
    "남자가 고개를 끄덕이더니, 다른 경비병 쪽으로 다가가 갑자기 검을 뽑아 그를 베어 넘겼다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:3
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_8140841f:

    # THUG @ talk "LONG LIVE THE VULSHAN!"
    THUG @ talk "불샨이여 영원하라!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:4
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_4a266463:

    # MARKUS "Well this isn't how I expected things to go!"
    MARKUS "이런 식으로 될 줄은 몰랐는데!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:7
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_600b097f:

    # "Suddenly, the whole Hall erupted into violence."
    "갑자기 홀 전체가 폭력으로 불타올랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:9
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_0e51501d:

    # "Me and Markus transformed and threw ourselves into the fight."
    "나와 마커스는 변신하여 싸움 속으로 뛰어들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:27
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_20c289b2:

    # TAREK "What is this madness? Traitors! Show yourselves!"
    TAREK "이게 무슨 광기야? 배신자들! 모습을 드러내라!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:28
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_d975eceb:

    # "Tarek's eyes glanced over towards us."
    "타렉의 눈이 우리를 향해 번뜩였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:29
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_b8c3e99f:

    # TAREK "M-Monsters! What have you brought into this place you fools?!"
    TAREK "괴-괴물! 이 바보들아 도대체 무엇을 이곳에 끌어들인 거야?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:30
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_6d204d91:

    # THUG @ talk "You are the traitor Tarek! No longer will we be subservient to your lies!"
    THUG @ talk "네가 배신자다 타렉! 더 이상 네 거짓말에 굴복하지 않을 것이다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:31
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_d22b5624:

    # THUG @ talk "VULSHAN! LET US END THIS!"
    THUG @ talk "불샨이여! 이제 끝내자!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:42
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_24e3e8fa:

    # "Tarek finally dropped to the floor, gashes and wounds deep into his flesh as he wretched up blood, the surviving Vulshan hacking at him with his blades."
    "타렉이 마침내 바닥에 쓰러졌다. 살점 깊숙이 난 상처와 자국에서 피를 토해내며, 살아남은 불샨족이 그를 칼로 난자했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:43
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_ceb971cc:

    # "Finally, they turned towards me and Markus."
    "마침내 그들이 나와 마커스를 향해 돌아섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:52
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_627a4832:

    # THUG @ talk "The deed is done."
    THUG @ talk "일은 끝났다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:53
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_45ed71ba:

    # THUG @ talk "Go now, before the guards arrive, we will clean up the mess."
    THUG @ talk "이제 가라, 경비병들이 도착하기 전에. 우리가 뒷정리를 할 테니."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:54
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_e3c5742c:

    # "Turning towards a terrified Nijah, I called her forward and she nervously stepped closer, her face sickly pale white as her eyes remained fixed on me and Markus in our other forms."
    "겁에 질린 니자를 향해 돌아서서, 나는 그녀를 불렀고 그녀는 긴장한 채 다가왔다. 얼굴은 병적으로 창백했고, 그녀의 눈은 다른 형태의 나와 마커스에게 고정되어 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:58
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_c454721e:

    # NIJAH "You... You are both..."
    NIJAH "너희... 너희 둘 다..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:59
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_d600ab27:

    # MC @ talk "This one, Nijah... Her debt is to be wiped."
    MC @ talk "이쪽은 니자다... 그녀의 빚은 탕감되어야 한다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:60
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_e2c3ff73:

    # THUG @ talk "Consider it done! Now go!"
    THUG @ talk "그렇게 하겠다! 이제 가라!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/DamzelInDiztrezz/scr_DamzelDizt_vushanRoute.rpy:63
translate kr qst_DamzelDizzt_3_VulshanRevolt_aebc85e5:

    # "Taking Nijah by hand, I led her away with Markus as we hurried away into the night."
    "니자의 손을 잡고, 나는 마커스와 함께 그녀를 이끌어 밤으로 급히 사라졌다."

